ved","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-10-24T14:05:20Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T17:00:43Z","closed_at":"2025-10-24T17:00:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4, 4.5 stable, 4.5.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - macOS Ventura (13.7.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe fuzzy matching in the Select Scene/Script/Resource dialogue is fantastic compared to the old system, but needs a priority tweak:\n\nIf you type the full filename of a file, it should be listed first in the search results.  Currently, it appears the system prioritizes files with shorter paths.  \n\nAs a result, there are some files I cannot specify by typing and pressing return; I must use the arrow keys or mouse to select the second result.\n\n**Workaround**: in creating a test project, I found that leading with `/` works around the problem, so e.g. I can search for `/menu` to prioritize `res://arenas/menu.*` over `res://pause_menu.*`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached project.  Press the keyboard shortcut for Select Resource.\n1. Type `menu.tscn`\n\n**Expected**: `res://arenas/menu.tscn` is selected.\n**Actual**: `res://pause_menu.tscn` is selected.\n\nSimilar results for Select Scene and Select Script dialogs.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[fuzzy-match-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23124975/fuzzy-match-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111995/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}